<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Hasil Foto DSCBooth Anda</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #faf5ec; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #faf5ec; padding: 40px 10px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <!-- Main Email Container -->
        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 580px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4dacb; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(122, 51, 39, 0.06);">
          
          <!-- Top Accent Banner -->
          <tr>
            <td height="6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #7a3327, #b54a33, #e08a6e);"></td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Header Section -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 35px 40px 20px 40px;">
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">
                    <span style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #7a3327; letter-spacing: -0.5px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', -apple-system, sans-serif; display: block;">
                      DSCBooth
                    </span>
                    <span style="font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; color: #a79c8c; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; font-family: monospace; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">
                      Developer Student Club
                    </span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 20px 40px 30px 40px;">
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                <tr>
                  <td style="color: #1c1712; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', -apple-system, sans-serif; padding-bottom: 15px;">
                    Halo, <%= name %>!
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color: #6b6375; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center; padding-bottom: 25px;">
                    Terima kasih telah bersenang-senang di <strong>DSC Photobox</strong>! Foto-foto keseruanmu telah berhasil diproses oleh sistem dan siap untuk diunduh sebagai kenangan manis.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                
                <!-- CTA Button -->
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 25px;">
                    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td align="center" bgcolor="#b54a33" style="border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(181, 74, 51, 0.3);">
                          <a href="<%= zipUrl %>" target="_blank" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 30px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;">
                            Unduh File ZIP Foto 📸
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Details Card -->
                <tr>
                  <td style="background-color: #faf5ec; border: 1px solid #e4dacb; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; color: #7a7266; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #7a3327; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px;">Info Tambahan</span>
                    Arsip ZIP ini berisi seluruh foto original resolusi tinggi (webcam snapshots) serta kolase strip foto yang telah dikompilasi dengan template pilihanmu.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer Area -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #faf5ec; border-top: 1px solid #e4dacb; padding: 25px 40px; text-align: center;">
              <p style="margin: 0; color: #a79c8c; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; font-family: monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;">
                Developer Student Club
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #c4b9a8; font-size: 10px; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;">
                DSCBooth © 2026 • Semua hak cipta dilindungi.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
